     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與戰前軍旅",
      "en": "Origins and pre-war service"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "據波蘭國家記憶研究院（IPN）的人物條目，亨里克·蘇哈爾斯基1898年11月12日生於格倫博舒夫（Gręboszów）。他自1919年2月起在波蘭軍隊的第16步兵團服役；1930至1938年在布列斯特（Brześć nad Bugiem）的第35步兵團擔任連長與營長；1928年升上尉，1938年升少校。",
      "en": "The IPN biographical entry says Henryk Sucharski was born on 12 November 1898 in Gręboszów. He served in the 16th Infantry Regiment of the Polish Army from February 1919, was a company and battalion commander in the 35th Infantry Regiment at Brześć nad Bugiem in 1930–1938, and was promoted captain in 1928 and major in 1938."
     },
