     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "被俘、義大利與身後",
      "en": "Captivity, Italy and reburial"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "IPN 的 Casamassima 頁稱，他被德軍關押到戰爭結束；1945年7月向義大利的波蘭第2軍團司令部報到，1946年1月出任第6喀爾巴阡步槍營營長，同年8月30日因腹膜炎逝世。該頁並稱，其遺骸於1971年8月21日運回波蘭，並於9月1日葬在西盆半島的戰爭公墓。",
      "en": "The IPN page on Casamassima says he stayed in German captivity until the end of the war, reported to the headquarters of the Polish II Corps in Italy in July 1945, received the post of commander of the 6th Carpathian Rifle Battalion in January 1946, and died on 30 August 1946 of peritonitis. It adds that his remains were taken to Poland on 21 August 1971 and buried on 1 September at the war cemetery on Westerplatte."
     },
